        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 6 For EIM the relevant authorization data of the SECC is the authorization status. For PnC the relevant authorization data of an EVCC includes the credentials of the TLS sessions including VAS, and the relevant authorization data of an SECC includes the credentials of the TLS sessions including VAS, the certificate chains received from the EV, validation and revocation check results of those certificates, and the authorization status.",
            "block_bbox": [
