            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 1 In dynamic control mode the SECC needs to dynamically adjust the power profile based on grid demands, etc. A pause initiated by the EVCC contradicts the intent of dynamic control mode where the SECC controls the power profile, not the EVCC.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
